config_management 0.3.5 switched the config daemon libraries from
@score_logging//score/mw/log to @score_baselibs//score/mw/log:frontend, so the
daemon no longer links the DLT (remote) backend and kRemote falls back to
console. Link the logging backends into the binary again.

diff --git a/score/config_management/config_daemon/code/BUILD b/score/config_management/config_daemon/code/BUILD
index f044bb6..c80905d 100644
--- a/score/config_management/config_daemon/code/BUILD
+++ b/score/config_management/config_daemon/code/BUILD
@@ -75,5 +75,7 @@ cc_binary(
         "//score/config_management/config_daemon/code/factory/details:factory_impl",
         "@score_lifecycle//score/launch_manager:lifecyclemanager_cc",
         "@score_lifecycle//score/launch_manager:runapplication_cc",
+        # Links the mw::log backends (incl. DLT/remote); the libraries only depend on the frontend.
+        "@score_logging//score/mw/log",
     ],
 )
